token","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/SizeSemanticToken","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SizeSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SizeSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Basically a size semantic token, used for width and height values, is a _ raw token,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it has the same final type, to keep grammar clean and clear with design system grammar."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider","title":"OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"component  tokens of badge","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"badge","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSBadgeStandard"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSBadgeIcon"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSBadgeCount"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBadgeComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BadgeComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"badge","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Badge","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of dimensions ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProviders"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebadgecomponenttokensprovider","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}]},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"image"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","title":"Theme Orange","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider/sizeMedium":{"title":"sizeMedium","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebadgecomponenttokensprovider\/sizemedium","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider\/sizeMedium","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sizeMedium","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SizeSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic04SizeB5Tokena"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token dimensions._5xsmall (= 16)"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}